},"test-your-storage-boundary","Test your storage boundary",[468,966,967,968,972,973,705],{},"Check the ",[969,970,971],"a",{"href":295},"storage contracts",": uniqueness under concurrency,\ntest\u002Flive separation, omitted versus null updates, and a declined ",[472,974,975],{},"store",[468,977,978,979,982],{},"For ",[969,980,981],{"href":313},"webhooks",", test valid, invalid, stale, and rotated signatures\nusing an independent HMAC signer. Concurrent copies must commit once. A failed\nreaction must roll back rows, audit markers, and outbox work, then succeed on retry.\nAlso test unknown events and out-of-order snapshots. Keep timestamp checks enabled.",[961,984,986],{"id":985},"live-test-mode-workflow","Live test-mode workflow",[988,989,990,1002,1008,1023],"ol",{},[991,992,993,994,997,998,1001],"li",{},"Set ",[472,995,996],{},"VATLY_API_KEY"," to a real ",[472,999,1000],{},"test_"," key. Use customer and catalogue IDs from\nits storefront and mode. Test keys do not create real charges.",[991,1003,1004,1005,705],{},"Expose your local webhook route through an HTTPS tunnel. Register the public\nURL and save its signing secret as ",[472,1006,1007],{},"VATLY_WEBHOOK_SECRET",[991,1009,1010,1011,1014,1015,1018,1019,1022],{},"Pay through a ",[969,1012,1013],{"href":301},"hosted checkout",". Save the checkout\u002Forder IDs and\nconfirm signed ",[472,1016,1017],{},"checkout.paid"," and ",[472,1020,1021],{},"order.paid"," deliveries.",[991,1024,1025],{},"Check duplicate and failed deliveries. Delete or disable temporary endpoints\nbefore closing the tunnel; record any resources you create.",[468,1027,1028,1031,1032,1035,1036,631,1039,1035,1042,1035,1045,1048,1049,1052,1053,1056],{},[472,1029,1030],{},"vatly.testHelpers()"," exposes ",[472,1033,1034],{},"advanceRenewal",", ",[472,1037,1038],{},"forceRenewalPaid",[472,1040,1041],{},"forceRenewalFailed",[472,1043,1044],{},"forceOrderPaymentPaid",[472,1046,1047],{},"forceOrderPaymentFailed",", and the\nSDK-style ",[472,1050,1051],{},"fastForwardRenewal","\u002F",[472,1054,1055],{},"simulateOrderPayment",". These mutate account data.\nUse them only with permission and disposable test resources, not existing\nsubscriptions or orders just because the key is in test mode.",[961,1058,1060],{"id":1059},"test-your-edge-runtime","Test your edge runtime",[468,1062,1063],{},"For edge hosts, also run your app in the local edge runtime with its storage adapter.\nNode tests alone do not check edge compatibility.",[468,1065,1066,1067,1073,1074,705],{},"See the ",[969,1068,1072],{"href":1069,"rel":1070},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fguides\u002Ftesting",[1071],"nofollow","testing guide"," and\n",[969,1075,1078],{"href":1076,"rel":1077},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference\u002Ftest-helpers",[1071],"Test Helpers API reference",[1080,1081,1082],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .swJcz, html code.shiki .swJcz{--shiki-light:#E53935;--shiki-default:#F07178;--shiki-dark:#F07178}html pre.shiki code .sbssI, html code.shiki .sbssI{--shiki-light:#F76D47;--shiki-default:#F78C6C;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C}html pre.shiki code .sHdIc, html code.shiki .sHdIc{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-light-font-style:itali